flowchart LR
    User[Student] --> UI[React + TypeScript UI]
    UI -->|multipart image| API[FastAPI]
    API --> Validate[Validate size, format, dimensions, EXIF]
    Validate --> Compare{Prediction request}
    Compare -->|HOG + HSV| ML[LinearSVC model]
    Compare -->|resize + normalize| CNN[CNN model]
    ML --> API
    CNN --> API
    API --> DB[(SQLite prediction metadata)]
    API -->|prediction + metrics JSON| UI
    Dataset[PlantVillage local folders] --> Prep[Prepare, dedupe, split]
    Prep --> Manifest[(Shared split manifest)]
    Manifest --> MLTrain[Train ML]
    Manifest --> CNNTrain[Train CNN]
    MLTrain --> Artifacts[(Local artifacts + metrics)]
    CNNTrain --> Artifacts
    Artifacts --> ML
    Artifacts --> CNN
